<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
total revenue increased by approximately S$1.6 million or 22.5% to approximately S$8.8 million for the six-month period ended June 30,
2023 from approximately S$7.2 million for the six-month period ended June 30, 2022. The increase was attributable to the increase in
revenue generated from our sale of cleaning systems and other equipment business of approximately S$1.8 million, which resulted primarily
from new orders for our precision cleaning systems, offset by an approximately S$0.2 million decrease in revenue from our provision of
centralized dishwashing and ancillary services business.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

