<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Although
the cost of revenue derived from our provision of centralized dishwashing and ancillary services business was essentially stable, the
cost of revenue derived from our sale of cleaning systems and other equipment business increased by almost S$1.3 million or 50.6%. This
increase was primarily due to increased sales of cleaning systems.</FONT></P>

